# Admin panel (docs/OFFERS.md, Hosting). Strict CSP: the only network origin is the Supabase project.
/*
  X-Robots-Tag: noindex, nofollow
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: no-referrer
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=63072000; includeSubDomains
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=(), payment=(), usb=()
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data: https://*.supabase.co; connect-src 'self' https://*.supabase.co; base-uri 'self'; form-action 'self'; frame-ancestors 'none'; object-src 'none'
  Cache-Control: no-cache
